Glossary
Term	Meaning
PIMS	The master asbestos/compliance database, which holds every survey line
Contractor portal	The current front end that shows PIMS asbestos data to staff and contractors
Fabric	Microsoft Fabric. A suite of data tools, including Power BI, and the new data platform replacing WhereScape. Not a new system for end users
Register	A consolidated, property-level view of asbestos: one line per room or element
Management survey	A routine survey with limited intrusion
Refurbishment / targeted survey	An intrusive survey of an area before works
Waste consignment note	Evidence that asbestos has been removed and disposed of
Air test	An air clearance test carried out after removal
Presumed / no access	An area not inspected, so it is treated as possibly containing asbestos

